# 🌑 AETHERIA — EVENT SYSTEM

> **Events are the moments when the world reacts.**
>
> A character can change.
> A faction can rise.
> A village can fall.
> A forgotten secret can be discovered.
> And sometimes, during a mission on the Tower floor, a hero can surpass their own limits.

---

# 1. EVENT SYSTEM OVERVIEW

The **Event System** is responsible for managing dynamic events that occur throughout Aetheria.

The Event System works together with the:

```text
Game Manager System
Game State System
Time System
RNG System
Character System
Quest System
Combat System
Tower System
Floor System
Faction System
NPC System
Enemy System
Recruit System
Inventory System
Database System
AI System
```

The Event System does not independently control the entire world.

Instead:

> **Game State determines whether an event can happen.**

Then:

> **Event System determines what event occurs and what consequences it produces.**

