# ⭐ 20. STAR 7 SPECIAL EVENT

Star 7 is called:

# **ASCENSION EVENT**

A character cannot simply use normal resources to become Star 7.

The character must experience a special event while participating in a mission inside the Tower.

```text
Character
   ↓
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
   ↓
Active Mission
   ↓
Tower Floor
   ↓
Special Event Trigger
   ↓
ASCENSION EVENT
   ↓
Character Trial
   ↓
Success
   ↓
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
```

