# ⚠️ 25. STAR 7 SHOULD NOT BE GUARANTEED

The event should not automatically happen every time the conditions are met.

Instead:

```text
Eligibility
    ↓
Event Trigger Check
    ↓
RNG
    ↓
Possible Event
```

This preserves the RNG identity of Aetheria.

However, the system can later implement:

```text
Pity Counter
Event Progress
Hidden Probability
Guaranteed Condition
```

to prevent excessive frustration.

