# 🌑 71. CORE DESIGN PRINCIPLE

The Event System follows one major rule:

> **Events should not simply give rewards. Events should change the state of the world.**

A treasure event can change Inventory.

A character event can change Character State.

A faction event can change Faction State.

A death event can change Quest State.

A Cult event can change World State.

A Star 7 event can change Character State, Relationship State, Story State, and Mission State.

